WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,020
How are you studying?

2
00:00:01,020 --> 00:00:04,020
I should be able to make greenhouses now, right?

3
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,020
Mr. Zhu

4
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:08,020
If I want to build a greenhouse to grow vegetables at the stall next door, is that okay?

5
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,020
It's hard to tell

6
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:12,020
It depends on the environment of the stall next door.

7
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:14,020
You need to know its temperature, humidity, and soil quality

8
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,020
Very complicated

9
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:17,020
I don’t have any information here right now.

10
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:19,020
Can't give you a straight answer

11
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:20,020
What kind of information is needed?

12
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,020
Only then can you make a judgment

13
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:24,020
It would be best if you take me to the field for exploration.

14
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,020
field exploration

15
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,020
That's definitely not possible

16
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:28,110
I can take a video for you

17
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:31,110
And can I bring some soil back for you to take a look at?

18
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:32,110
Although not that accurate

19
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:33,110
But it shouldn't be much of a problem

20
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:36,240
Then I can ask Mr. Zhu to help me then.

21
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,560
Your family is really handsome

22
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,560
Having a hard time

23
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,560
And not just my family

24
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,560
Our whole place is like this

25
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:43,560
Life is very difficult

26
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:44,560
There is no other way

27
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,560
I can only think of a way to get everyone something to eat and drink.

28
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:47,560
In this way, everyone's life will be better

29
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,560
Only then might it be slightly better

30
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,560
Then you are doing something to benefit others

31
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,560
I had some misunderstandings about you before

32
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,560
I'm really sorry

33
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,560
So be it

34
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,560
There is a problem with this

35
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:57,560
you can come to me anytime

36
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:59,560
And we have to work here for a while.

37
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:00,560
I'm here anyway

38
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,560
If you don’t know, come to me anytime
